GET {{base_url}}/v1/languages/overrides/administrator/{{lang_code}}/{{override_key}}
X-Joomla-Token: {{api_key}}
Accept: application/vnd.api+json

### Update Administrator Language Override
# @name Update Administrator Language Override
PATCH {{base_url}}/v1/languages/overrides/administrator/{{lang_code}}/{{override_key}}
